{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.PiTensorMonomialBasis","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.PiTensorMonomialBasis","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.PiTensorProduct"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.monoEquiv_tensorPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.monoEquiv_tensorPerm","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L168-L185","doc":"**The correspondence.** Under the monomial basis, permuting the tensor FACTORS is\nprecomposition on index tuples — i.e. exactly `indexPerm`, at `σ⁻¹`.\n\nThis is what transports the `q = 1` character computation from the concrete model onto\nthe actual tensor power. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.tensorPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.tensorPerm","kind":"def","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L163-L166","doc":"Permuting the tensor factors, as `PiTensorProduct.reindex`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.monoEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.monoEquiv","kind":"def","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L156-L161","doc":"**The missing Mathlib basis, in the case that matters.** For `V` free with basis\nindexed by `κ`, the tensor power `V^{⊗α}` is the free module on index tuples `α → κ`\n— the monomial basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_toMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_toMono","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L148-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_toMono_tprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_toMono_tprod","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L127-L146","doc":"The generator case of the round trip: this is the monomial EXPANSION of a pure\ntensor, `v i = ∑ k, v i k • single k 1` pushed through multilinearity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.toMono_ofMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.toMono_ofMono","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L110-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ofMono_apply","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L106-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.ofMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.ofMono","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L99-L104","doc":"Backward, as a linear map: a function on index tuples to the tensor power. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.toMono_tprod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.toMono_tprod","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L95-L97","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.toMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.toMono","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L90-L92","doc":"Forward: the tensor power to functions on index tuples. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.monoMultilinear_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.monoMultilinear_apply","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L87-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.monoMultilinear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.monoMultilinear","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/PiTensorMonomialBasis.lean#L75-L84","signatureChunk":0}]}